environments. The goal is to avoid guessing and instead design around observable behavior."}, {"id": "d9c22ff5-866d-4b9d-940b-f5e739077f12", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Research methods for digital marketers", "children": [{"id": "4aa96a2e-0985-49ec-8d47-c5fce9dfde86", "type": "concept", "title": "Surveys, interviews, reviews, and social listening"}, {"id": "3dc0ee57-959d-40d0-a400-4ba1843538ad", "type": "concept", "title": "Keyword, competitor, and market research"}, {"id": "6c242bff-878b-4adc-b0a9-7b12ff4a6728", "type": "concept", "title": "Web analytics and CRM data as research inputs"}, {"id": "ea80c21d-eba1-4bf7-81ac-4eed8f24d977", "type": "concept", "title": "Bias, sample quality, and data limits"}], "description": "Students learn how to combine qualitative and quantitative sources to understand audiences before building campaigns."}, {"id": "87c392e7-0c5a-4ab3-a388-2111c1f30a58", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Segmentation and targeting", "children": [{"id": "da1139d6-eeaa-409b-ac51-245d74cc02d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Demographic, psychographic, behavioral, and value-based segments"}, {"id": "4a4586bc-9009-433e-bb56-f956c7705bfc", "type": "concept", "title": "RFM, CLV, loyalty, and lifecycle segments"}, {"id": "bf65d856-047b-480f-a508-dfe84ec718db", "type": "concept", "title": "Lookalike audiences and modeled targeting"}, {"id": "44f505df-8c94-4f1a-a11e-0b827a6e9ff1", "type": "concept", "title": "Avoiding exclusionary or sensitive targeting"}], "description": "Segmentation turns broad audiences into actionable groups. This section introduces meaningful segmentation criteria and responsible targeting choices."}]}, {"id": "7a73f587-f7ca-4867-b059-cf062c2efdf2", "type": "topic", "title": "Owned Media, Websites, UX, and Conversion Foundations", "description": "Treat websites, landing pages, and conversion paths as the operational center of digital marketing.", "children": [{"id": "c4040f16-782d-4a29-aee0-3827a720be79", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Websi