erations"}], "description": "Content marketing works when it serves audience needs and business goals at the same time. Students learn how to build a durable editorial system."}, {"id": "c22204e2-cb60-448c-baa5-36dc99ee9fed", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Formats, storytelling, and distribution", "children": [{"id": "2f8632c7-572b-4283-9f5b-b0847caed2d8", "type": "concept", "title": "Blogs, guides, newsletters, webinars, podcasts, and video"}, {"id": "4a2dc871-998f-4952-bea9-53d05cfcce24", "type": "concept", "title": "Narrative hooks and examples"}, {"id": "015e3651-a3bc-4fd7-bd79-c5d28f674293", "type": "concept", "title": "Repurposing and atomization"}, {"id": "8740728b-b380-4b8b-9e23-e91f469107e2", "type": "concept", "title": "Owned, earned, and paid distribution"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches students to choose formats based on audience behavior, channel fit, and message complexity."}, {"id": "5c78b8b0-1b2b-4100-b434-31623f488bc9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Content measurement", "children": [{"id": "1eef5047-8373-4b83-b119-def30db28d47", "type": "concept", "title": "Reach, engagement, lead quality, assisted conversions, and retention"}, {"id": "11c95a37-4bbc-4cee-9cd0-5c8dbf3762c6", "type": "concept", "title": "Content attribution challenges"}, {"id": "775a1411-1063-4811-a1da-e2288f831fc0", "type": "concept", "title": "Topic authority and organic growth"}, {"id": "bd64b2c0-b655-4284-94f0-e08e968f9d38", "type": "concept", "title": "Editorial dashboards and learning reviews"}], "description": "Students learn why content success should be measured beyond page views and likes."}]}, {"id": "06c9f5cc-59b9-446b-8966-80172dc7a1c8", "type": "topic", "title": "Email Marketing, CRM, Lifecycle, and Retention", "description": "Use permission-based messaging, CRM data, automation, and lifecycle strategy to deepen customer relationships.", "children": [{"id": "1d744829-9b5e-4ece-8b0c-5e89e3c0c70e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Permission, lists, and deliverabili