s"}], "description": "Students connect lifecycle marketing to revenue, CLV, customer success, and retention."}]}, {"id": "50420ad2-5765-4011-8f74-b4919b48e2ae", "type": "topic", "title": "Social Media Marketing and Community Management", "description": "Design platform-specific social strategies, content calendars, engagement practices, and community norms.", "children": [{"id": "57299d81-b4f6-4a68-9a96-39c49e185a49", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Platform strategy", "children": [{"id": "0b0e0004-eb25-4b69-a765-bc205899362c", "type": "concept", "title": "Instagram, TikTok, LinkedIn, YouTube, X, Reddit, and emerging platforms"}, {"id": "be37632d-65a1-44e7-a61a-d35fda5666f4", "type": "concept", "title": "Platform affordances and algorithmic feeds"}, {"id": "0a189e4f-a266-4c67-b136-4da3f6b34cd2", "type": "concept", "title": "Organic versus paid social roles"}, {"id": "63b131db-9dc5-469f-b952-55a33c1dea06", "type": "concept", "title": "B2B versus B2C platform selection"}], "description": "Different platforms reward different behaviors. Students learn to choose platforms based on audience, format, culture, and campaign objectives."}, {"id": "eb507e37-7928-4f18-a4ca-6e2b94a6e2d9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Community and engagement", "children": [{"id": "4f2431a7-e26a-4b25-87bf-3215891920a9", "type": "concept", "title": "Community guidelines and response playbooks"}, {"id": "dc343f13-1786-446a-b5bc-df98e7190e49", "type": "concept", "title": "Social listening and sentiment analysis"}, {"id": "143d4600-9b03-4295-8476-5036029d1a88", "type": "concept", "title": "Comment moderation and escalation"}, {"id": "6e296336-0d45-42a6-a1dd-5c6fdf78f37b", "type": "concept", "title": "Brand voice, tone, and conversational norms"}], "description": "Social media is partly a relationship system. This subtopic teaches listening, response, moderation, and brand voice."}, {"id": "66b990f1-bc7e-4c8a-9c10-cf5c03cec3eb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Social content operations", "children": [{"